                <pb facs="0412" n="306" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg306"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Egan to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-01-20"><hi rendition="#italic">January 20,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Egan reports that the minister of foreign affairs has not yet returned an
                    answer in the matter of withdrawing Mr. Matta’s telegram of December 11.</p>
            </div>
